WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.032 --> 00:00:02.857
- [Narrator] There's a world
renowned topiary garden

00:00:02.857 --> 00:00:05.400
in the tiny town of
Bishopville, South Carolina,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.797
and that garden was created by this man;

00:00:07.797 --> 00:00:09.151
a man named Pearl.

00:00:09.151 --> 00:00:12.401
(lively, bouncy music)

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:20.124
- [Pearl] I'm Pearl Fryar,
and this is my garden.

00:00:21.226 --> 00:00:23.310
- [Narrator] Pearl
started the garden in 1981

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.742
with the goal of winning Yard of the Month

00:00:24.742 --> 00:00:26.992
from the local garden club.

00:00:34.202 --> 00:00:35.470
- [Narrator] There was
a stereotype at the time

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.637
that African Americans
didn't keep up their yards.

00:00:57.263 --> 00:01:00.263
- [Narrator] Pearl now
has over 300 plants,

00:01:00.263 --> 00:01:01.738
most of which were
throwaways that came from

00:01:01.738 --> 00:01:04.821
the recycling bin at a local nursery.

00:01:24.731 --> 00:01:26.200
- [Narrator] So many people
drove by Pearl's house

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.456
to see his garden that he
opened it up to the public.

00:01:28.456 --> 00:01:31.055
- Hey, that looks like a sheep!

00:01:31.055 --> 00:01:32.222
- A big sheep.

00:01:35.937 --> 00:01:39.770
- What else do you want
to look at on the map?

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:20.572
(chiming)

